Changes made in this fork:
  - Renamed the project, Python package (artemis -> phonepilot), client package
    (artemis-client -> phonepilot-client), CLI, MCP server name, config file
    (config/phonepilot.jsonc) and environment variable prefix
    (ARTEMIS_* -> PHONEPILOT_*).
  - phonepilot/mcp/adb_server.py: take_screenshot now returns an MCP image
    instead of a base64 text string, so vision-capable MCP clients can see it.
  - `phonepilot mcp --install claude` also registers the key-free
    `phonepilot-direct` server (the stdio ADB tools) for Claude Code.
  - README: fork notice, Claude Code section, benchmark attribution.

Unchanged on purpose: the prebuilt Android accessibility helper
(packages/artemis-accessibility-helper, package id com.artemis.helper) and the
compiled web console under phonepilot/resources/showcase_ui. Both keep upstream
names until they are rebuilt. Images under docs/assets/ are upstream's.
